// .markdownlint-cli2.jsonc - markdownlint-cli2 options: what the linter scopes in and out
//
// The rules are configured in .kit/markdownlint.jsonc; this file sets the scope. The repository's .gitignore
// files say what is left out, so worktrees/ is never linted, and the glob form reads the ignore files inside the
// tree being linted, so a worktree lints the same as the root checkout.
//
// see: https://github.com/DavidAnson/markdownlint-cli2#markdownlint-cli2jsonc
{
  "gitignore": "**/.gitignore"
}
